Comment: 0,0:05:15.16,0:05:17.88,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k85}Every {\k44}bridge {\k29}we {\k113}build
Comment: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:20.42,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k36}You {\k28}think {\k30}it's {\k20}yours {\k21}to {\k38}burn {\k34}it {\k47}down
Comment: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:22.76,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k33}Just {\k38}burn {\k28}it {\k133}down
Comment: 0,0:05:22.76,0:05:25.76,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k45}When {\k109}everything {\k40}is {\k106}gone
Comment: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:28.64,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k42}You'll {\k34}wish {\k16}you {\k45}only {\k45}heard {\k38}us {\k68}out
