Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:11.53,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你點了把火 眼看它燒毀一切
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.53,0:05:14.90,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}像你常做的那樣 試圖自救吧
