Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.73,0:05:28.61,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你才會想傾聆我們的聲音
